WEBVTT

00:00:11.480 --> 00:00:13.400
(soft music playing)

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.360
We're with you.

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:19.080
Thank you.

00:00:27.320 --> 00:00:29.920
Our time is close, my
brothers and sisters.

00:00:30.920 --> 00:00:32.720
Days of hiding are over.

00:00:35.240 --> 00:00:37.480
The world will hear our voice.

00:00:40.680 --> 00:00:42.120
And it will be deafening.

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:43.960
(crowd cheering)

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:52.720
You didn't come here to
betray Dumbledore...

00:00:53.920 --> 00:00:56.480
You know in your pure-blood
heart...

00:00:58.080 --> 00:00:59.920
your place is here.

00:01:02.040 --> 00:01:04.680
To believe in me is to
believe in yourself.

00:01:09.880 --> 00:01:11.800
(suspenseful music playing)

00:01:16.600 --> 00:01:18.800
Prove your loyalty, Mr. Kama.

00:01:20.400 --> 00:01:22.160
(cheering continues)

00:01:24.560 --> 00:01:26.320
(footsteps)

00:01:29.480 --> 00:01:32.400
(water dripping)

00:01:38.680 --> 00:01:40.560
(muffled talking)

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:42.440
...Vulnera Sanentur.

00:01:43.040 --> 00:01:47.120
Rennervate Vulnera Sanentur.

00:01:48.040 --> 00:01:52.680
Rennervate Vulnera Sanentur.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:00.280
Rennervate Vulnera Sanentur.

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:01.720
(muffled whimper)

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:05.840
There.

00:02:05.920 --> 00:02:07.360
(squeaking)

00:02:07.440 --> 00:02:08.760
There, there.

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:11.920
There.

00:02:13.800 --> 00:02:15.360
Come, look.

00:02:18.960 --> 00:02:20.120
(Grindelwald) Hmm.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:23.000
This is why we are special.

00:02:25.960 --> 00:02:29.600
To conceal our powers is not
merely an affront to ourselves...

00:02:31.160 --> 00:02:32.440
it's sinful.

00:02:33.080 --> 00:02:34.240
(trills)

00:02:37.320 --> 00:02:39.240
(uneasy music playing)

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:48.000
Was there another?

00:02:49.200 --> 00:02:50.360
(Credence) Another?

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:54.480
That night, was there another
Qilin?

00:02:54.560 --> 00:02:56.800
(tense music playing)

00:02:58.040 --> 00:02:59.080
I don't think so...

00:03:00.920 --> 00:03:02.320
That's twice you failed me.

00:03:02.400 --> 00:03:06.160
Do you not understand the
danger you put me in?

00:03:07.000 --> 00:03:08.760
(Credence breathes heavily)

00:03:09.840 --> 00:03:11.480
One last chance.

00:03:12.120 --> 00:03:13.240
Understood?

00:03:16.320 --> 00:03:17.360
Find it.

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:21.920
(Qilin trilling)

00:03:30.800 --> 00:03:32.560
(purring)

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.160
(magical music playing)

00:03:45.160 --> 00:03:46.520
(bird screams)

00:03:59.160 --> 00:04:01.080
(dramatic music playing)

00:04:07.680 --> 00:04:08.640
(door shuts)

00:04:09.800 --> 00:04:11.160
(Jacob whispering) Hey, Newt.

00:04:12.000 --> 00:04:13.520
What is this place?

00:04:14.480 --> 00:04:16.400
The room we require.

00:04:20.640 --> 00:04:24.040
I trust you all have the
tickets that Bunty gave you?

00:04:24.120 --> 00:04:26.520
You'll need them to gain
access to the ceremony.

00:04:26.600 --> 00:04:27.640
What do you think, Newt?

00:04:27.720 --> 00:04:29.320
Can you tell which one is yours?

00:04:29.400 --> 00:04:30.280
No.

00:04:31.080 --> 00:04:32.880
Good. I'd be worried if you could.

00:04:32.960 --> 00:04:35.120
(Lally) I assume the Qilin's
in one of these cases.

00:04:35.200 --> 00:04:36.240
(Dumbledore) Yes.

00:04:36.320 --> 00:04:37.280
Well, which one is it?

00:04:37.320 --> 00:04:38.120
Which one indeed.

00:04:38.560 --> 00:04:40.720
Ooh, it's like a
three-card monte thing.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.560
Like a shell game thing.

00:04:42.640 --> 00:04:43.720
Like a short con.

00:04:45.680 --> 00:04:47.520
Never mind, it's a Muggle thing.

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.880
Grindelwald will do
anything within his powers

00:04:49.960 --> 00:04:52.200
to get his hands on our rare
friend.

00:04:52.280 --> 00:04:54.400
Therefore, it's
essential that we keep

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.520
whoever he dispatches on
his behalf guessing...

00:04:58.080 --> 00:05:00.560
so the Qilin gets to
the ceremony safely.

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:06.240
If, by teatime, the Qilin,
not to mention all of us,

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:08.880
are still alive,

00:05:08.960 --> 00:05:11.720
we should consider our
efforts a success.

00:05:11.800 --> 00:05:15.000
For the record, nobody ever
died playing three-card monte.

00:05:16.680 --> 00:05:18.280
An important distinction.

00:05:19.440 --> 00:05:22.080
All right, everybody choose a
case and we'll be on our way.

00:05:22.160 --> 00:05:25.680
Mr. Kowalski, you and I will
proceed together first.

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:27.480
Me?

00:05:31.880 --> 00:05:32.960
Okay. (sighs)

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:36.520
(clears throat)

00:05:36.600 --> 00:05:38.520
(pensive music playing)

00:05:56.880 --> 00:05:58.800
I'm looking forward to you
educating me a little further

00:05:58.880 --> 00:06:01.480
on the finer points
of three-card monte.

00:06:03.520 --> 00:06:04.480
(Jacob) Mm.

00:06:07.080 --> 00:06:08.080
My pleasure.

00:06:08.640 --> 00:06:09.600
(gasps)

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:15.240
Well, good luck, everybody.

00:06:17.960 --> 00:06:18.800
Good luck.

00:06:20.000 --> 00:06:22.600
And you too, Bunty girl.

00:06:25.360 --> 00:06:26.720
See you, Bunty.

